source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A character reference in a link title is not resolved: Jira escapes the title into the `title` attribute, so the reader sees the reference itself; jiro carries those characters and writes the `&` back escaped.
-- input.jira --
[x|http://x|t&#124;u]
-- rendered.html --
<p><a href="http://x" title="t&amp;#124;u" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">x</a></p>
-- want.md --
[x](http://x "t&amp;#124;u")
-- warnings.json --
[]
